<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Wish - Audiomack Trap Symphony Version</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Trippie Redd, Diplo</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Wish (Audiomack Trap Symphony Version)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3STIi4I7eGMJJJhGRIfVli</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.550" end="00:14.050">Ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.190" end="00:15.770">Baby, what you wishin' for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.770" end="00:18.230">Maybe you should wish it more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.230" end="00:20.850">Maybe the world is yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.850" end="00:23.300">Maybe when it rains it pours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.300" end="00:25.760">I don't know how to wish anymore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.760" end="00:28.170">I don't know how to wish anymore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.170" end="00:29.910">Or do I?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.910" end="00:34.670">Wish you'd get out my face, might go MIA</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.670" end="00:39.790">Might just blow my brain, I'd be Kurt Cobain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.790" end="00:42.540">I can't feel my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.540" end="00:45.030">I can't feel my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.030" end="00:47.540">I can't feel my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.540" end="00:51.570">I can't feel my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.570" end="00:53.860">I wish you will find your chill</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.860" end="00:56.340">'Cause Lord knows this shit get real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.340" end="00:58.960">And for this price, you know you'd kill</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.960" end="01:01.570">Man it's big brack, you know the deal</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.570" end="01:03.780">Man it's big slatt, you know the deal</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.780" end="01:06.530">Draco a big dragon, fire hell</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.530" end="01:09.120">Can't save me, man, save yourself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.120" end="01:13.070">'Cause I do not need no help</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.070" end="01:15.760">Keep on wishin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.760" end="01:18.210">Keep on wishin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.210" end="01:23.060">Keep on wishin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.060" end="01:31.060" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.710" end="01:33.210">Yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.070" end="01:35.060">Uh, I tell that bih, like, ooh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.060" end="01:37.400">Baby, what you wishin' for?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.400" end="01:39.960">Maybe you should wish it more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.960" end="01:42.430">Maybe the world is yours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.430" end="01:44.950">Maybe when it rains it pours</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.950" end="01:47.670">I don't know how to wish anymore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.670" end="01:50.010">I don't know how to wish anymore</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.010" end="01:51.790">Or do I?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.790" end="01:56.430">Wish you'd get out my face, might go MIA</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.430" end="02:01.510">Might just blow my brain, I'd be Kurt Cobain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.510" end="02:04.260">I can't feel my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.260" end="02:06.810">I can't feel my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.810" end="02:09.330">I can't feel my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.330" end="02:14.560">I can't feel my face</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.560" end="02:17.620">Fuck, my voice is goin' now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:17.620" end="02:21.620" /></div></body></tt>